{"ticker":"KIM","updated":"2026-11-07T00:25:41Z","profile":{"longName":"Kimco Realty Corporation","shortName":"Kimco Realty Corporation (HC)","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://www.kimcorealty.com","fullTimeEmployees":710,"marketCap":16957780992,"trailingPE":23.850466,"forwardPE":28.75493,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":7.717132,"pegRatio":3.37,"targetMeanPrice":26.17857,"targetHighPrice":30.0,"targetLowPrice":23.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.019,"earningsGrowth":1.137,"grossMargins":0.69184,"operatingMargins":0.36361,"profitMargins":0.34058997,"totalRevenue":2197420032,"beta":0.931,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":26.65,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":19.76,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.37},"summary":"Kimco Realty is a real estate investment trust (REIT) and leading owner and operator of high-quality, open-air, grocery-anchored shopping centers and mixed-use properties in the United States. The company's portfolio is strategically concentrated in the first-ring suburbs of the top major metropolitan markets, including high-barrier-to-entry coastal markets and Sun Belt cities. Its tenant mix is focused on essential, necessity-based goods and services that drive multiple shopping trips per week. The company has specialized in shopping center ownership, management, acquisitions, and value-enhancing redevelopment activities for more than 65 years. With a proven commitment to corporate responsibility, Kimco Realty is a recognized industry leader in this area. As of September 30, 2026, the company owned interests in 561 U.S. shopping centers and mixed-use assets comprising 99 million square feet of gross leasable space. Kimco Realty Corporation was incorporated in 1958 in Maryland and is based in Jericho, New York.","summary_zh":"Kimco Realty 是一家房地產投資信託公司 (REIT)，也是美國高品質露天雜貨購物中心和混合用途物業的領先所有者和營運商。該公司的投資組合策略性地集中在主要大城市市場的一環郊區，包括高進入門檻的沿海市場和陽光地帶城市。其租戶組合側重於必需品和必需品，這些商品和服務每週帶動多次購物。該公司專注於購物中心所有權、管理、收購和增值重建活動超過 65 年。 Kimco Realty 憑藉對企業責任的堅定承諾，成為該領域公認的行業領導者。截至 2026 年 9 月 30 日，該公司擁有 561 個美國購物中心和混合用途資產的權益，其中可租賃總面積為 9,900 萬平方英尺。 Kimco Realty Corporation 於 1958 年在馬裡蘭州成立，總部位於紐約州傑里科。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產投資信託基金 - 零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":22.53,"h":22.69,"l":22.35,"c":22.52,"v":3437300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":22.57,"h":22.6,"l":22.24,"c":22.36,"v":4448800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":22.3,"h":22.45,"l":22.25,"c":22.3,"v":3298400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":22.24,"h":22.55,"l":22.23,"c":22.46,"v":3028600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":22.47,"h":22.6,"l":22.34,"c":22.39,"v":3489600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":22.38,"h":22.46,"l":22.26,"c":22.34,"v":3417200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":22.3,"h":22.38,"l":22.05,"c":22.11,"v":4117100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":22.13,"h":22.38,"l":21.92,"c":21.95,"v":5236900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":21.95,"h":22.21,"l":21.95,"c":22.17,"v":2646100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":22.22,"h":22.28,"l":21.91,"c":21.94,"v":7513100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":21.84,"h":21.91,"l":21.69,"c":21.77,"v":3750100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":21.78,"h":21.97,"l":21.71,"c":21.9,"v":2619700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":21.89,"h":21.94,"l":21.6,"c":21.63,"v":3491300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":21.64,"h":21.79,"l":21.45,"c":21.48,"v":2907200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":21.61,"h":21.73,"l":21.45,"c":21.59,"v":3267400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":21.6,"h":21.71,"l":21.47,"c":21.67,"v":3208400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":21.67,"h":21.87,"l":21.63,"c":21.85,"v":2970700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":21.7,"h":21.91,"l":21.43,"c":21.52,"v":4799300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":21.5,"h":21.57,"l":21.2,"c":21.36,"v":2671100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":21.38,"h":21.7,"l":21.38,"c":21.47,"v":3180600},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":21.53,"h":21.82,"l":21.37,"c":21.52,"v":3461600},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":21.49,"h":21.54,"l":21.24,"c":21.37,"v":4241900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":21.32,"h":21.36,"l":21.2,"c":21.29,"v":2793700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":21.27,"h":21.41,"l":21.13,"c":21.23,"v":2593800},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":21.24,"h"